Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 48.51969 633.3701 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3.8 Tm 13 TL /F2 9.2 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Answer:) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( Headless mode runs the browser without displaying the browser UI and is commonly used in CI/CD.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 48.51969 610.3701 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3.5 Tm /F2 11.5 Tf 15 TL (18. What is headed mode?) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 48.51969 591.3701 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3.8 Tm 13 TL /F2 9.2 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Answer:) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( Headed mode displays the browser window and is useful for debugging, development and learning.) Tj T* ET
