q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3.5 Tm /F2 11.5 Tf 15 TL (19. How do you launch a browser in headed mode?) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 48.51969 549.3701 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3.8 Tm 13 TL /F2 9.2 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Answer:) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( Use BrowserType.LaunchOptions\(\).setHeadless\(false\).) Tj T* ET
