q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3.5 Tm /F2 11.5 Tf 15 TL (20. Why is headless mode commonly used in Jenkins?) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 48.51969 507.3701 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3.8 Tm 13 TL /F2 9.2 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Answer:) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( CI servers often do not require or provide a graphical browser environment, so headless execution is convenient.) Tj T* ET
