Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 48.51969 391.3701 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3.8 Tm 13 TL /F2 9.2 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Answer:) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( Browser represents an actual browser process.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 48.51969 368.3701 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3.5 Tm /F2 11.5 Tf 15 TL (23. What is BrowserContext?) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 48.51969 336.3701 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 16.8 Tm 13 TL /F2 9.2 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Answer:) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( BrowserContext is an isolated browser session with independent cookies, local storage, session state and) Tj T* (authentication.) Tj T* ET
