q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 16.8 Tm 13 TL /F2 9.2 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Answer:) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( Browser represents the browser process. BrowserContext represents an isolated browser session inside that) Tj T* (browser.) Tj T* ET
