q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 3.8 Tm 13 TL /F2 9.2 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Answer:) Tj /F1 9.2 Tf ( No. It can support API testing, network mocking, authentication setup and other test-related workflows.) Tj T* ET
